Changes from BoomBx:
- Added "YouTube Live" tab: search YouTube and stream audio live into the
  virtual mic (VB-Cable) and speakers, without downloading files.
- YouTube clips can be pinned to soundboards (with start/end times) and
  played with the same hotkeys, volume, EQ and pitch controls.
- Fixed Text-to-Speech playback sharing one stream between two outputs.
- New name, logo and default icon; app data now in %AppData%\BoobiesSoundpad;
  log file moved from Desktop to the app data folder.
